-ba","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-059-ba","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-ba:line043","quote":"霸二子，基、壹。五鳳中，封基爲吳侯，壹宛陵侯。基侍孫亮在內，太平二年，盜乘御馬，收付獄。亮問侍中刁玄曰：「盜乘御馬罪云何？」玄對曰：「科應死。然魯王早終，惟陛下哀原之。」亮曰：「法者，天下所共，何得阿以親親故邪？當思惟可以釋此者，柰何以情相迫乎？」玄曰：「舊赦有大小，或天下，亦有千里、五百里赦，隨意所及。」亮曰：「解人不當爾邪！」乃赦宮中，基以得免。孫皓即位，追和、霸舊隙，削基、壹爵土，與祖母謝姬俱徙會稽烏傷縣。","source_term":"霸二子，基、壹"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-wu059-ba-2","interpretation_note":"本句所記父子；識別後綴不表示長幼。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}},{"id":"572_278_cba_BB","label":"孫壹〔孫霸子，吳志考證疑名字〕","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","review":"ai_provisional","aliases":[{"surface":"壹","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-059-ba:line043:m0006","c-sanguozhi-059-ba:line043:m0018","c-sanguozhi-059-ba:line043:m0191"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-059","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-ba","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-059-ba","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-ba:line043","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-ba:line043:m0006","quote":"壹"},{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-059","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-ba","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-059-ba","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-ba:line043","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-ba:line043:m0018","quote":"壹"},{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-059","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-ba","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-059-ba","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-ba:line043","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-ba:line043:m0191","quote":"壹"}],"identity_note":"依本篇具名、稱謂及其所在原句辨認；引書原字存於各自來源。","family_path":{"connection":"father","parent_person_id":"572_278_cba_B","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-059","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-ba","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-059-ba","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-ba:line043","quote":"霸二子，基、壹。五鳳中，封基爲吳侯，壹宛陵侯。基侍孫亮在內，太平二年，盜乘御馬，收付獄。亮問侍中刁玄曰：「盜乘御馬罪云何？」玄對曰：「科應死。然魯王早終，惟陛下哀原之。」亮曰：「法者，天下所共，何得阿以親親故邪？當思惟可以釋此者，柰何以情相迫乎？」玄曰：「舊赦有大小，或天下，亦有千里、五百里赦，隨意所及。」亮曰：「解人不當爾邪！」乃赦宮中，基以得免。孫皓即位，追和、霸舊隙，削基、壹爵土，與祖母謝姬俱徙會稽烏傷縣。","sou